 "_ruqyah": "The five of the ruqyah screen's six duas that an-Nawawi's al-Adhkar actually carries. The sixth - «أعوذ بكلمات الله التامات التي لا يجاوزهن بر ولا فاجر» - is NOT in this edition: zero hits across all 338 chapters. It is therefore dropped, not reconstructed. ruqyah_catalog.dart already states the principle: «an absent dua is an honest gap; a dua typed in from memory with no takhrij behind it is not.» These carry explicit ids so the screen can address them for ever."
